      }, {
        "text": "} \\\\\n  \\hline                                                                        \n  Mouth \u0026 Salivary amylase \u0026 Starch, maltose"
      }, {
        "text": ", triolein, arachin \u0026 -- \\\\                            \n  \\hline                                                                        \n  Stomach \u0026 Gast"
      }, {
        "text": "ric amylase, pepsin \u0026 Starch, maltose, arachin, polypeptide \u0026 -- \\\\\n  \\hline"
      }, {
        "text": "                                                                        \n  Small Intestine \u0026 Pancreatic amylase, trypsin, lipase \u0026 Starch, maltose,"
      }, {
